.wrangler/
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
src/deck.generated.json
src/files.generated.json
# wrangler's own settings for a deploy (README step 4): a stand-in token, never a real one, but never committed
.env
# The Worker's static files, built by npm run things from git-ignored data/5s/fives/ (models, pages): never committed
# (all but .assetsignore, which keeps the folder in git: wrangler dev and deploy need it, even before npm run things)
public/*
!public/.assetsignore
